D25 (gromosXX 247c95c4): A-EDS FORMS 5/6 prevalences by plain exponentials.
md++/src/algorithm/integration/eds.cc:339-343 compute exp(-beta (V_i - E_i^R)) unshifted: below V_i - E_i^R ~ -709.78/beta
(-1770.6 kJ/mol at 300 K) a term is inf, the prevalences inf/inf = NaN, "prevalence >= 1/N" is false and no offset moves
(all above +745/beta: 0/0, the same). Fix: shift every exponent by the largest one (log-sum-exp); the prevalences are
unchanged where nothing overflows.

diff --git a/md++/src/algorithm/integration/eds.cc b/md++/src/algorithm/integration/eds.cc
--- a/md++/src/algorithm/integration/eds.cc
+++ b/md++/src/algorithm/integration/eds.cc
@@ -336,8 +336,13 @@
           std::vector<double> exp_vi(numstates);
           double prevalence = 0.0;
           double total_endstates_ene = 0.0;
+          // shifted by the largest exponent, so that no term overflows
+          double max_exponent = -1.0 * beta * (eds_vi[0] - eir[0]);
+          for (unsigned int state = 1; state < numstates; state++) {
+            max_exponent = std::max(max_exponent, -1.0 * beta * (eds_vi[state] - eir[state]));
+          }
           for (unsigned int state = 0; state < numstates; state++) {
-            exp_vi[state] = exp(-1.0 * beta * (eds_vi[state] - eir[state]));
+            exp_vi[state] = exp(-1.0 * beta * (eds_vi[state] - eir[state]) - max_exponent);
             total_endstates_ene += exp_vi[state];
           }
 
